    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50432" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμαντ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fibrous</i>, of the hair,
