			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλοιός, κλῶνες</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.84
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.15
			</span></i>; of asbestos, <i><span class="en">
